# Use move-files skill for moves

When moving or renaming files/folders, always use the `move-files` skill and its
`node .cursor/skills/move-files/scripts/move.mjs --from "<src>" --to "<dst>"`
workflow. Never use PowerShell `Move-Item`/`Rename-Item` or ad-hoc scripts.
